  "notes": "Wordmark \"Insta360\" only: the Commons file is the horizontal lockup (lens symbol + wordmark); the 4 symbol subpaths were dropped. Inkscape matrix(1.33333 0 0 -1.33333 0 777.2) + translate() baked into coordinates with svgpath (y-flip), then shifted so the tight bbox starts at 0,0 and rounded to 0.01. Letter counters (a, 0, 6) are separate subpaths with no overlaps, so evenodd fill is used. Single path, no background, no ® or tagline in source. Brand colour is #FFEE00 (yellow) but logo is rendered monochrome by the app. For a symbol-only alternative, Simple Icons slug \"insta360\" (CC0) exists."
